# ---- Local-only working docs ----
# The decision record and the agent brief stay on this machine. BRIEF.md in particular is written in
# the first person and carries personal context — what the itch was, what the alternatives cost —
# that belongs to the author rather than to the repository. Both are still the source of truth for
# *why*; they are simply not published.
docs/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
